{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_chat_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "d0f585db0b9c60919359efa439071cdedd22ba6640255ada1c0a4cd82b34b17b", "ja": "この前、洗濯物干してたら、\n空に不思議な光が飛んでて……\nうーん、なんだったんだろう？", "zh": "前些天晾衣服的时候，\n看到天空中飞过一道不可思议的光……\n嗯——到底是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "6c19523ecf0c45d3dc62cc0d380e0cfe354a1cfb37565aeadb59b5d113f0a33a", "ja": "まさか、UFO！？　……ううん、\nありえない。飛行機とか、\n人工衛星とかだよね、きっと。", "zh": "难道是UFO！？……不对，\n不可能啦。肯定是飞机，\n或者人造卫星之类的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "568f6f65b1a4aa34eb394b7f4a35bea2099889216497a1027f6f47b67c2a11b5", "ja": "でもUFOっていったら、\n『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』を\n思い出しちゃうなぁ～。", "zh": "不过一提到UFO，就会想起《☆哔哩哔哩星球☆》呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "06a33870cd4d040650e8b7721db3c5c62ad975cc5dc99a5b9d7f6644b24849b0", "ja": "放送をリアルタイムで見るために、\n頑張って早起きしてたっけ……\nふふっ♪　また見たいなぁ～。", "zh": "为了准时收看播出，\n我还拼命早起过来着……\n呵呵♪ 真想再看一次呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
